      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently the mutual display on nameplates may say they're a friend of someone who isn't actually in the instance. \n\nMore useful behavior would be to choose a mutual who is currently in the instance, if one is present.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1763] Display Mutual on Nameplate that is currently in instance, if possible.",
